WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
Welcome, educators.

00:00:01.013 --> 00:00:06.431
Future Ready AI is designed to support teachers, instructional leaders, and school teams

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:11.612
as they bring artificial intelligence into learning in meaningful and responsible ways.

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:15.125
We know that educators need more than theory.

00:00:15.305 --> 00:00:19.889
You need practical strategies, classroom-ready resources, and guidance you can trust.

00:00:20.069 --> 00:00:24.237
That’s why we focus on helping educators understand AI tools,

00:00:24.417 --> 00:00:27.334
teach students how to use them responsibly,

00:00:27.514 --> 00:00:28.764
strengthen digital citizenship,

00:00:28.944 --> 00:00:33.945
and build learning experiences grounded in creativity, critical thinking, and human judgment.

00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:37.875
Whether you are exploring AI for the first time

00:00:38.055 --> 00:00:40.556
or building a broader implementation plan,

00:00:40.736 --> 00:00:44.903
we’re here to support you every step of the way.

00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:48.000
Let’s prepare learners for the future — together.
